thentication yes / passwordauthentication no / permitemptypasswords no; live SSH attempt restricted to password auth is rejected with 'Permission denied (publickey)'"},{"requirement":"Key-based SSH login actually functions for opsadmin","command_ids":["cmd-bb433dd49be546ad"],"summary":"SSH login using a temporary ed25519 key added to authorized_keys succeeds (whoami=opsadmin, LOGIN_OK), proving the pubkey auth path works end-to-end; temp key was removed afterward leaving only the required key (cmd-2473e1a7cf284871)"},{"requirement":"Baseline health capture before restart","command_ids":["cmd-948d3a3dbe1a4c73"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 4d70780a-0bff-4d50-8c53-62faa1ccc945, ssh.service active, key-only sshd policy, opsadmin user and authorized_keys all healthy prior to restart"},{"requirement":"Restart acknowledgement returns before disconnection","command_ids":["cmd-ac07b6e824754e0b"],"summary":"`sudo reboot` issued via backgrounded nohup; command returned 'reboot issued, pid 1848' immediately"},{"requirement":"Proof of changed boot identity (actual restart, not just service restart)","command_ids":["cmd-dca65da390154ee3","cmd-366c5b595c034890"],"summary":"Node was unreachable (connection timed out) immediately after reboot, then came back with a new boot_id 9a2a77b3-d923-483b-82bf-53abb5ac9502 (differs from baseline 4d70780a...) and uptime 0 min"},{"requirement":"Post-restart recovery of required services and data","command_ids":["cmd-f9e31b5c11bd4e12","cmd-92e83eafa1dc4a1e"],"summary":"After reboot, ssh.service active, key-only auth policy intact, opsadmin user and correct authorized_keys entry present, /run/sshd recreated by tmpfiles rule, and a live SSH pubkey login test succeeded (LOGIN_OK_POSTREBOOT), confirming full functional recovery"}]},"ttft_ms":1908,"type":"result","duration_ms":101832,"uuid":"bb375946-d17a-4e5a-bd66-1d3562bb244e","ttft_stream_ms":790,"time_to_request_ms":101,"queued_turn_count":0}
